<title>UK: Deutsche Genossenschafts sets 1.0 billion mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Genossenschafts sets 1.0 billion mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE GENOSSENSCHAFTS HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    20.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    20.NOV.96</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  100.185   FULL FEES  20 PFENNIGS</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 PF     SELL CONC  10 PF</p>
